  <name>Pipette</name>
  <summary>Keymap editor for Vial-compatible keyboards</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Pipette is an independent keymap editor compatible with Vial. It communicates with
      Vial keyboards over USB HID to configure keymaps, macros, lighting, and more.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Keymap editing with layers, drag and drop, and undo/redo</li>
      <li>Tap dance, combo, key override, alternate repeat key, and macro editors</li>
      <li>RGB lighting, QMK settings, and a matrix tester</li>
      <li>Snapshots, favorites, and import/export (.vil, .pipette, keymap.c, PDF)</li>
      <li>Built-in typing test and typing analytics</li>
      <li>Optional cloud sync across devices and sharing on Pipette Hub</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">pipette-desktop.desktop</launchable>
